WEBVTT

00:33:27.829 --> 00:33:30.329
the world is more than it seems

00:33:30.329 --> 00:33:35.829
and that we want to see things that we
can't imagine and that we don't expect.

00:33:35.829 --> 00:33:38.079
And so I feel like that is a natural.

00:33:38.954 --> 00:33:41.496
Aspect to telling a story,

00:33:41.496 --> 00:33:47.163
and I just think that whether it's writing
a a book or making a show or

00:33:47.163 --> 00:33:50.038
a movie, it's all a bit of a magic trick.

00:33:50.121 --> 00:33:52.954
You are so much more comfortable
not knowing than I am.

00:33:52.996 --> 00:33:55.788
I immediately want to answer. I have to
figure out the secret, but then you

00:33:55.788 --> 00:33:57.496
can never see the trick again.

00:33:58.746 --> 00:34:02.038
You can admire the the skills
and the genius of